#AUTHORS  Blythe~

#HELPS
-1 TETHYR_CHANGES~
03.18.09 - Fixed an issue that caused [*****] BUG: Mpforce - Forcing oneself: vnum 15101..
           The line was - mpforce arilynmob north
           Changed to   - north (Order)
03.18.09 - Fixed an issue that forced players attempting to awaken Zoastria to leave
           and reenter the crypt to progress in the moonblade quest.  The quest now
           flows properly.  (Order)
03.27.09 - Fixed the door leading from 15168 to 15167.  The state of the door (open/closed) 
           will now match from both rooms. (Order)
~
-1 TETHYR~
The Kingdom of Tethyr is off the Sea of Swords, south of Waterdeep.
It encompasses the city Zazesspur and the Tethir Forest.  The forest of
Tethir is under a great threat and it is said that they need help in
defeating the threat.

There is one quest in Tethyr, to save Tethir Forest.
To start it look for the Captain in the Breaching Whale Tavern on the
Harbour.  The quest is best done solo, and it can be done easily with a
non-reincarnate.  (I know - I have done it :) The equipment it
yields is level 45, and is best done by the future wearer of the
equipment.

(a) Area created by Blythe

Last Updated October 22nd, 1998



{a}BLYTHE
~
0 $~

#RANGES 20 99 0 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG

#MOBILES
#15101
arilynmob moonblade~
Arilyn Moonblade~
Arilyn Moonblade is here.~
She is a half elf that is a broad swords width short of 6 feet tall,
with raven dark hair that hangs in careless waves about her shoulders.
Her eyes are an unusual dark blue flecked with bits of gold.  She has a
tense and watchful air about her.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
65 BODY_HAND BODY_FOOT 10d10+8000 1d10+165
10000 415376
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>give_prog i15103~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 1
  say Yes, I have been thinking about what the Captain 
  say said to me.  I want to help the wild elves of 
  say Tethir Forest.  If I am going to be able to help them,
  say I am going to need some things from Tinkersdam.
  say Go $n and see what he has for me.
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 2
  emote melts back into the shadows.
  mpgoto 15100
  mpjunk all
endif
~
>give_prog i15119~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 3
  say Thanks I needed this.
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 4
  say I am going to go to the Forest to try and convince
  say the wild elves to let me help them.  
  say Come to the Forest later.  
  say I may need your help again.
  emote melts into the shadows.
  mpgoto 15100
  mpjunk all
endif
~
>speech_prog p Thank the gods!~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 5
  say Don't!! $n is a friend of mine.
  say $e is here to help us!  Aren't you $n?
endif
~
>speech_prog help~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 6
  say Try to get the help of the Lythari.
  say My friend Ganamede may take you to their den.
  say Tell him I sent you.
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 7
  mpecho Arilyn disappears into the trees above you.
  mppurge wildelfmob
  mppurge wildelfmob
  mpgoto 15100
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 8
  say Great $n!
  emote looks worried.
  say We still need more help.  When I was in Abrum Assante's
  say palace I saw an elven female, lying inside a long case
  say in his hidden treasure room.  I think she may have been
  say one of the former owners of my moonblade.
  say Rescue her from there.
  say To get the hidden treasure chamber you ... 
  mpecho A shrill whistle pierces the air.
  say Sorry I have to go.  Find that elf!
  mpecho Arilyn disappears into the trees above.
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 10
  mpgoto 15100
else
  if quest(0, 5, $n) == 11
    say Great!  I will meet you there.
    mpmset $n quest 0 5 13
    mpecho Arilyn disappears into the trees above you.
    mpgoto 15100
  else
    if quest(0, 5, $n) == 14
      connect 0 15271
      mpforce zoastriamob north
      mpforce foxfiremob north
      mpforce ganamedemob north
      mpmset $n quest 0 5 15
      mpforce $n north
      north
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>fight_prog 100~
if hitpercent ($i) < 50
  mpgoto 15100
  mpecho Arilyn's Moonblade glows blue and she disappears.
endif
~
|
#15102
macumail captain carreigh~
Captain Macumail~
Captain Macumail is sitting here.~
His mass of curly fair hair, his long and neatly trimmed whiskers,
the bright blue and green weave os his trade mark kilt, the
extravagant ruffles at the throat and cuffs of his white
shirt - all these things set him apart from most of the Breaching
Whale's rough-clad clientele.  Weighing at least 300 pounds, and
stretching up to 7 feet he is also one of the biggest.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
65 BODY_HEAD BODY_FOOT 10d10+3800 1d10+65
10000 415376
POS_RESTING POS_RESTING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 0
  mpecho Captain Macumail nurses an ale and looks at you glumly.
  say I failed to get Arilyn Moonblade to help the 
  say Elven Queen.
  say Do you want to try to convince her, $n?
else
  if rand(40)
    if quest(0, 5, $n) == 16
      say You did well $n.
      say You helped to save Tethir Forest.
    else
      emote raises his Ale towards you.
    endif
  else
    mpechoat $n The Captain winks at you and offers to buy you an ale.
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
mpoload 15103
give parchment $n
say Try giving this to Arilyn.
say Last I heard she was hanging around the School of Stealth.
mpmset $n quest 0 5 1
~
>death_prog 1~
mpoload 15137
~
|
