>speech_prog yes~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 5
  emote and his elves lower their bows.
  say So you want to help us?
  say There is an evil in the forest.
  emote spits.
  say They are cutting down the trees!!
  mpforce arilynmob say Sacrilege!
  say We cant take them alone.  We need HELP.
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 6
endif
~
>speech_prog p golden thorn~
say Ahhh yes that is very hard to find.  But it does grow around Tethir Forest.  You need to look very carefully for it.
mpmset $n quest 23 1 1
~
