#15104
bunlap~
Bunlap~
Bunlap of Zhentil Keep looks at you threateningly.~
He is massive with a cruel look on his face.  He has a
black beard, with a scmimatr of a nose and eyes that are cold and
gray.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
-1000 S
65 BODY_HAND BODY_FOOT 10d10+2500 1d1+45
10000 415376
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 15
  mpquiet on
  mptransfer arilynmob 15100
  mppurge
  mpquiet off
  mpechoat $n Your friends move out around the camp and attack Bunlaps workers.
  laugh $n
  say You think you and your wussy forest friends can kill me?
  mpkill $n
else
  say What are you doing here?  You shouldn't be here.
  mpkill $n
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 15
  mpecho All cheer the death of Bunlap.
  mpquiet on
  mptransfer arilynmob
  mpmload 15103
  mpquiet off
  mpforce arilynmob say We have given you some items in thanks for you help $n.
  mpforce foxfiremob shout Tethir forest is safe again thanks to $n!
  mpoload 15113
  mpoload 15114
  mpquiet on
  cast 'giant strength' $n
  mpoload 15138
  give eye $n
  mpoload 15134
  give moonblade $n
  mptransfer arilynmob 15100
  mppurge foxfiremob
  drop dark
  drop iron
  mpquiet off
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 16
endif
~
>fight_prog 70~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 15
  mpquiet on
  cast heal $n
  cast heal $n
  mpquiet off
  mpechoat $n Your allies aid you in the battle.
else
  mpquiet on
  cast heal $i
  cast heal $i
  cast heal $i
  cast heal $i
  mpquiet off
  say By Cyric, I shall kill you!
endif
~
