tinkersdam~
Tinkersdam~
Tinkersdam is working on an invention here.~
He wears a tunic of bright yellow, the traditional colour of Lantan
and sandals on his bare feet.  His plump extremely bowed legs are
hairless, as is his face - no doubt the result of many explosions his
work occassions.~
