>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 2
  say Hmmm, Arilyn sent you for the things she ordered, hey?
  say I have them here for her somewhere.
  emote rifles through a table of oddments.
  say Ahhh here we are.
  mpoload 15119
  give mask $n
  mpmset $n quest 0 5 3
  mpecho Tinkersdam absentmindedly returns to working on one of his creations.
else
  mpechoat $n Tinkersdam mutters away as he works on one of his creations.
endif
~
