    mpat 15100 mpforce arilynmob mpgoto 15265
    mpecho Arilyn jumps down lightly from the trees to stand before you.
    mpforce arilynmob say Did the Lythari agree to help us?
else
  if quest(0, 5, $n) == 11
      mpat 15100 mpforce arilynmob mpgoto 15265
      mpecho Arilyn jumps down lightly from the trees in front of you.
      mpforce arilynmob say We are going to attack the logging camp now.
      mpforce arilynmob say Are you with us $n?
