The harbour master stands here.~
Dressed in typical sailors garb, he is ready to take you to the
DESTINATION of your choice.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
65 BODY_HAND BODY_FOOT 10d10+5000 1d10+75
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
say Do you require passage aboard the Mist Walker?
~
>speech_prog destination location where yes~
say We can take you to several different ports.
say Moonshae Islands, Holy River, Isle of Mist,
say Troll Island and Ocean City.
say Where would you like to go?
~
>speech_prog p Moonshae Islands~
mpmset $n quest 13 5 1
say Passage will cost you 250,000 gold.
~
>speech_prog p Holy River~
mpmset $n quest 13 5 2
say Passage will cost you 250,000 gold.
~
>speech_prog p Isle of Mist~
mpmset $n quest 13 5 3
say Passage will cost you 250,000 gold.
~
>speech_prog p Troll Island~
mpmset $n quest 13 5 4
say Passage will cost you 250,000 gold.
~
>speech_prog p Ocean City~
mpmset $n quest 13 5 5
say Passage will cost you 250,000 gold.
~
>bribe_prog 250000~
if quest(13, 5, $n) == 0
  say You must pick a destination first.
  mpquiet on
  mpmadd $n gold 250000
  mpquiet off
  mpechoat $n The Harbour Master give you back your gold.
else
  if quest(21, 1, $n) == 0
    if quest(22, 1, self) == 0 
      mpmset $n quest 21 1 1
      say You may board the Mistwalker now. 
      connect 3 15275
    else
      mpmset $n quest 21 1 1
      mpecho The Mist Walker is out to sea.  
      mpecho You will have to wait till she returns.
    endif
  endif
endif
~
