#15237
Tinkersdam's Cave~
It is an odd looking lair, vast and open, yet cluttered enough to
give the impression of bustling activity despite the fact that it
has but one occupant.  Several book laden shelves are propped against
the cave walls, and half finished wonders litter a dozen or so
long tables.  Small cooking fires dot the cave, and a muted symphony
of hissing, crackling sounds rise from pots of bubbling, often
luminous substances.~
